OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of drink covers funded
OL,4,Ato tackle spiking
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands more reusable drink covers
OL,7,Fhave been funded to help people protect
OL,8,Fthemselves from spiking.
OL,10,FThe latest funding brought the total
OL,11,Fnumber of DrinkSeals ordered for
OL,12,FGuernsey since 2024 to 7,500.
OL,14,FThe covers stretch over most glasses
OL,15,Fand cups, leaving a small opening for a
OL,16,Fstraw, and are being made available
OL,17,Ffree to the community.
OL,19,FIn Guernsey, police received 140
OL,20,Freports of suspected drink spiking
OL,21,Fbetween 2019 and 2025, although there
OL,22,Fwere no formally confirmed cases.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
